### Create an appointment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ali Khan",
  "customerEmail": "ali@example.com",
  "startTime": "2026-10-01T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-01T11:00:00"
}

### Get all appointments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
### Should be 409 (double booking: overlaps 10:00-11:00)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Sara Ahmed",
  "customerEmail": "sara@example.com",
  "startTime": "2026-10-01T10:30:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-01T11:30:00"
}

### Should be 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/999

### Should be 400 (blank name, bad email)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "",
  "customerEmail": "not-an-email",
  "startTime": "2026-10-02T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-02T11:00:00"
}